      2 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">صمّغهُ</span></b> , inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَصْمِيغٌ</span>, <i>He put</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">صَمْغ</span> [i. e.

<i>gum</i>] <i>into it;</i> (O, K;) meaning, into ink. (O.)
― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  And <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">صمّغ بِالصَّمْغِ</span>, inf. n. as above, <i>He compacted the hair of his head</i> [<i>with gum</i>]. (Msb.)

